  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Competition, Community, and Educational Growth (2018), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has been cited 2 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Competition, Community, and Educational Growth by Kristopher Copeland and Garret L. Castleberry was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2018. Conceptually, the work connects to Competition (biology), Biology and Ecology.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 2 citations. Citations peaked in 2020 with 1 citing works. Notable citing venues include Argumentation and Advocacy. The citing authors are based in the United States.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 5 library collections.</p>",
